    "body": "@domenic observed that for `<input type=color alpha>` we do not have to set the proposed \"HTMLCompatible\" serialization parameter to true and could instead use the modern serialization. Which would mean instead of `rgba(...)` (that 2D canvas requires as discussed in #8917) you would get `color(srgb ...)` presumably. It would still be limited to 8-bits per color component, but it seems reasonable to me.",
